<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>9 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>7 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Ulf Kirsten, Paulo Sergio (both Bayer Leverkusen), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock), Fredi Bobic, Giovane Elber (both VfB Stuttgart)</p>
